WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.850
Section 3: Contact your Member of Parliament.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.425
They are legally required to respond to constituent correspondence.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:14.300
Use the MP Scorecard to check their voting record and lobbying contacts before you write.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:25.700
This section includes a ready-to-use letter template requesting action on lobbying reform, CFNIS oversight, and the Freedom of Information and Transparency in Advocacy Act.
